{
  "description": "Already-enforced results: a tool opts out of re-enforcement by returning an EnforcedResult marker bound to the signed context's signature. Honoured only on an exact, constant-time signature match, and only by executeWithEnforcement. An honoured marker skips masking, the size ceiling, each row filter or allowedTags filter whose field the policy hides, projects out or masks, and the similarity floor on a record with no present, unmasked score key when a score key is masked (and neither hidden nor projected out) or is hidden or projected out and absent. The first present, unmasked score key is always read, even a hidden one the tool left in, so a visible low score is never kept because a higher-precedence key was removed. The filters on visible, unmasked, allowed fields, the hidden-field strip, the allowed-field projection and maxResults are re-applied, because over already-enforced output they are no-ops.",
  "action": "executeWithEnforcement",
  "signingKey": "already-enforced-fixture-key-0123456789abcdef",
  "context": {
    "userId": "user-1",
    "tenantId": "tenant-1"
  },
  "otherContext": {
    "userId": "user-2",
    "tenantId": "tenant-1"
  },
  "markers": {
    "context": "EnforcedResult bound to the signature of the context the call runs under",
    "otherContext": "EnforcedResult bound to the signature of a different context signed with the same key",
    "tampered": "EnforcedResult bound to the context signature with its last character changed",
    "empty": "EnforcedResult bound to an empty signature",
    "null": "the tool returns the data unwrapped"
  },
  "substitutions": {
    "$CONTEXT_SIGNATURE": "replace with the signature of the context the call runs under"
  },
  "cases": [
    {
